{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Ye servants [D]of [G]God, [D/F#]your [Em]Masterproclaim,
[D]Andpublish [Em]abroad [G/B]His [D/F#]wonderful [Am]name;
[Bm]The [Em]name [Am/E]allvicto-rious [D7/F#]of [G]Jesusex [D]tol,
[Bm]His kingdomisglorious, [D7/F#]He [G]rules [Am]over [G]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]God ruleth [D]on [G]high, [D/F#]almighty to [G]save,
[D]and [G]still [D/F#]he [Em]is [D]nigh, [G/B]his [D/F#]presence [G]we [Am]have;
[Bm]the [Em]great [Am/E]congregation [D7/F#]his [G]triumph [D/F#]shall [Em]sing,
[Bm]ascribing [C/G]salvation [G]to [C]Jesus, [D7]our [G]King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]"Salvation [D]to [G]God, [D/F#]who [Em]sits [Am/C]on [D]the [G]throne!"
[D]Let [G]all [D/F#]cry [Em]aloud [G/B]and [D/F#]honor [G]the [Am]Son;
[Bm]the [Em]praises [B/D#]of [Em]Jesus [D7/F#]the [G]angels [Em]proclaim,
[Bm]fall [C]down [D7/A]on [C/G]their [D7/F#]faces [G]and [C]worship [D7]the [G]Lamb.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]Then let us [D]adore and [Em]give [Am/C]him [D]his [G]right,
[D]all [G]glory [Em]and [D]power, all [G]wisdom [Am]and [D]might;
[Bm]all [Em]honor [B/D#]and [Em]blessing [D7/F#]with [G]angels [Em]above,
[Bm]and [C]thanks [D7/A]never ceasing [G]and [C]infinite [G]love.
{end_of_verse}
